    "created_at": "2021-08-20T12:35:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-20T12:35:20Z",
    "body": "It does seem like a weird ceremony for the WebSocket constructor to mandate ws/wss even though it's immediately [just mapped to http/https](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-websocket-establish) anyway. I remember the first time I set up web socket handling server side years ago that this obfuscation made it harder to develop an initial understanding of how it worked - it's more misleading than not imo.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
