    "body": "now this is quite interesting... the http scheme hill looks a lot more inviting now. it would be very exciting for changes here can clean up the spec as well.\n\nI do think it would be weird if new `WebSocket('https://foo').url` was a `wss` but that's probably a bit far into the weeds at this point.",
