    "created_at": "2024-03-21T10:46:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-05-10T13:44:15Z",
    "body": "For folks affected by the change in browser behavior, here's the status as of today (2024-05-10):\r\n\r\n- Firefox shipped in 124.0 (released 2024-03-19)\r\n- Safari shipped this in 17 a.k.a. 19616.1.27 (released 2023-09-18)\r\n- Chromium shipped this in 125 (released 2024-05-08)\r\n  - ticket: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40244242\r\n  - review: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/5060558\r\n  - roadmap: https://chromestatus.com/feature/5848709993857024\r\n\r\nThe previously-mentioned https://github.com/whatwg/websockets/pull/45 has relevant links to track the implementations.",
